WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:02.265
- [Man] Hey.
- Hey.

00:00:02.265 --> 00:00:04.916
- [Man] Are you OK?
- Yeah I'm fine.

00:00:04.916 --> 00:00:07.669
I just found out that Beyoncé died.

00:00:09.043 --> 00:00:09.957
- Get the fuck out!

00:00:09.957 --> 00:00:12.709
- No, no, no, my cat,
my cat Beyoncé is dead.

00:00:12.709 --> 00:00:14.728
- [Man] Oh.
- I told you about her.

00:00:14.728 --> 00:00:17.515
- Right because you
named your cat Beyoncé.

00:00:17.515 --> 00:00:19.315
- [Quinta] Yeah.
- Fuckin' ey.

00:00:19.315 --> 00:00:20.395
- [Qunita] Well Ashley named it Beyoncé.

00:00:20.395 --> 00:00:22.855
I mean it's OK, she was
really old, you know,

00:00:22.855 --> 00:00:24.330
I moved out like a year ago,

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:27.654
and Beyoncé's pretty much Ashley's cat.

00:00:27.654 --> 00:00:30.521
She wanted to keep her, so I let her.

00:00:30.521 --> 00:00:32.715
I just really hope Ashley's doing OK.

00:00:32.715 --> 00:00:34.294
(loud sobbing)

00:00:34.294 --> 00:00:37.255
- Why couldn't you take me instead?

00:00:37.255 --> 00:00:38.821
I can't come in today.

00:00:38.821 --> 00:00:41.456
There's been a passing in my family.

00:00:41.456 --> 00:00:42.861
(sobbing)

00:00:42.861 --> 00:00:45.114
- Rest in peace Beyoncé.

00:00:45.114 --> 00:00:47.984
I'll remember you forever.

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:55.177
- [Ashley] Oh thank God!

00:00:55.177 --> 00:00:57.243
I thought I'd lost you too.

00:00:57.243 --> 00:01:01.014
(sobbing)

00:01:02.223 --> 00:01:03.814
- We should get started.

00:01:03.814 --> 00:01:05.416
I have to give the caterers a head count

00:01:05.416 --> 00:01:07.355
and I still haven't proof read my eulogy.

00:01:07.355 --> 00:01:08.458
- What caterers?

00:01:08.458 --> 00:01:09.538
- [Ashley] This place is nice.

00:01:09.538 --> 00:01:11.162
I can see why you abandoned Beyoncé and I.

00:01:11.162 --> 00:01:13.438
- I did not abandon you and Beyoncé.

00:01:13.438 --> 00:01:15.133
I had to be closer to work, you know that.

00:01:15.133 --> 00:01:17.362
- I know that's what you said.

00:01:17.362 --> 00:01:18.454
Can I put this in the fridge?

00:01:18.454 --> 00:01:19.638
- Yeah go ahead.

00:01:19.638 --> 00:01:21.298
And Ashley don't leave the door open.

00:01:21.298 --> 00:01:23.338
This is not a barn!

00:01:24.943 --> 00:01:26.580
So what's in that bag anyway?

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:27.858
- It's Beyoncé.

00:01:27.858 --> 00:01:28.902
- What?

00:01:28.902 --> 00:01:29.990
Excuse me Ashley?

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:30.856
The cat?

00:01:30.856 --> 00:01:32.391
- The crematorium wouldn't
take her till tomorrow,

00:01:32.391 --> 00:01:33.843
and I didn't want to leave her alone.

00:01:33.843 --> 00:01:35.328
- Oh my God Ashley!

00:01:35.328 --> 00:01:36.467
Eww!

00:01:36.467 --> 00:01:38.021
Ashley why would you put a
dead cat in my refrigerator?

00:01:38.021 --> 00:01:39.171
- I thought you'd want to say goodbye.

00:01:39.171 --> 00:01:40.750
- I don't want to say goodbye.

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:42.201
What if I eat the cat by accident Ashley?

00:01:42.201 --> 00:01:43.444
Did you think about that?

00:01:43.444 --> 00:01:44.802
What if I think it's a ham?

00:01:44.802 --> 00:01:45.905
Ohh!

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:47.647
And what are you doing with my beers?

00:01:47.647 --> 00:01:51.883
- I mean they're going to go
bad if we don't drink them.

00:01:51.883 --> 00:01:56.883
(heavy electronica music)

00:02:00.428 --> 00:02:02.983
- You don't think any
of this is a bit much?

00:02:02.983 --> 00:02:04.410
- Much?

00:02:04.410 --> 00:02:06.500
She was your baby.

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:09.739
You're the on who found her
behind an elementary school.

00:02:09.739 --> 00:02:12.026
You're the one who nursed
her back to health.

00:02:12.026 --> 00:02:14.244
You're the one she slept with.

00:02:14.244 --> 00:02:15.823
- Until I went home for Thanksgiving

00:02:15.823 --> 00:02:17.761
and she never forgave me.

00:02:17.761 --> 00:02:19.259
Every time I gave her her insulin shot

00:02:19.259 --> 00:02:21.609
she drew blood for Christ sake.

00:02:21.609 --> 00:02:23.647
- She loved hard.

00:02:23.647 --> 00:02:25.729
- No, no, no she attacked
our feet at night

00:02:25.729 --> 00:02:27.588
any time we tried to go to the bathroom.

00:02:27.588 --> 00:02:29.190
- Well who pees after dark?

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:30.548
- Everyone Ashley.

00:02:30.548 --> 00:02:32.441
Everyone goes to the bathroom after dark.

00:02:32.441 --> 00:02:34.947
And I don't know who you
think you're doing this for,

00:02:34.947 --> 00:02:36.666
but it's not for Beyoncé.

00:02:36.666 --> 00:02:37.502
(draws breath)

00:02:37.502 --> 00:02:38.304
- Yeah.

00:02:38.304 --> 00:02:40.324
She was a feral monster OK.

00:02:40.324 --> 00:02:41.461
She was a badass,

00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:44.364
and she wouldn't want
Bedazzled urns or a special

00:02:44.364 --> 00:02:46.349
guest appearance from Justin Guarini.

00:02:46.349 --> 00:02:47.173
- Fine!

00:02:47.173 --> 00:02:48.706
Then how would you suggest we send her

00:02:48.706 --> 00:02:51.803
to her final resting place?

00:02:55.670 --> 00:02:57.251
- You know what?

00:02:57.251 --> 00:03:01.046
I suggest we send her out like a G.

00:03:01.046 --> 00:03:05.470
No chills, no frills, and no caterers.

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:07.070
We take her back to the elementary school

00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:11.250
where we found her and we
bury her under the same tree.

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:14.571
Full circle, tonight.

00:03:14.571 --> 00:03:19.150
- Quinta, they're never
going to let us do that.

00:03:19.766 --> 00:03:23.460
- Ashley my dear, who said
anything about asking?

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:28.460
(heavy guitar music)

00:03:35.970 --> 00:03:36.608
- [Quinta] Wait.

00:03:36.608 --> 00:03:39.452
Ow, wait, wait.

00:03:39.452 --> 00:03:41.309
We can't drive...

00:03:41.309 --> 00:03:43.110
- Our faces can't drive.

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:44.665
(laughing)

00:03:44.665 --> 00:03:47.514
(heavy music)

00:03:47.514 --> 00:03:49.615
- Hi, I need a car.

00:03:49.615 --> 00:03:53.914
(French-style music)

00:03:53.914 --> 00:03:55.793
- [Ashley] Could you put on Taylor Swift?

00:03:55.793 --> 00:03:57.013
- [Quinta] All right, are you ready?

00:03:57.013 --> 00:03:58.162
- Yeah let's do this.

00:03:58.162 --> 00:03:59.403
- Let's go.

00:03:59.403 --> 00:04:01.121
- Wait, where's Beyoncé?
- Beyoncé!

00:04:01.121 --> 00:04:02.201
- [Ashley] Shit!

00:04:02.201 --> 00:04:04.059
Hello!
- [Quinta] Hey!

00:04:04.059 --> 00:04:06.501
- [Ashley] OK let's do this.

00:04:10.211 --> 00:04:12.022
- [Quinta] Did you just chuck the cat?

00:04:12.022 --> 00:04:13.322
- Sorry Beyoncé.

00:04:13.322 --> 00:04:15.061
OK give me a boost.

00:04:17.141 --> 00:04:18.338
- [Quinta] Where's the tree?

00:04:18.338 --> 00:04:20.188
- [Together] Over there.

00:04:20.188 --> 00:04:22.985
(puffing noises)

00:04:25.285 --> 00:04:28.441
- [Quinta] Security drive by.

00:04:31.728 --> 00:04:34.008
OK they're gone, let's go.

00:04:34.008 --> 00:04:36.688
(digging noises)

00:04:38.233 --> 00:04:39.512
- This isn't possible.

00:04:39.512 --> 00:04:41.923
- No I think we're getting somewhere.

00:04:42.785 --> 00:04:43.795
- Oh!

00:04:43.795 --> 00:04:44.887
Oh my God!

00:04:44.887 --> 00:04:45.907
Is that a femur?

00:04:45.907 --> 00:04:46.767
- Oh hell no!

00:04:46.767 --> 00:04:48.927
- Who is burying human bodies out here?

00:04:48.927 --> 00:04:50.006
- We have to take a break.

00:04:50.006 --> 00:04:52.954
- That is nasty!
- That's disgusting.

00:04:54.511 --> 00:04:57.273
- Ashley, I'm sorry.

00:04:57.273 --> 00:04:58.632
This is crazy.

00:04:58.632 --> 00:05:03.632
- No you were right, this is
what Beyoncé would've wanted.

00:05:03.838 --> 00:05:04.975
- You think?

00:05:04.975 --> 00:05:08.737
- Yeah, you always had
a special bond with her.

00:05:08.737 --> 00:05:09.933
- Yeah until we didn't.

00:05:09.933 --> 00:05:11.872
- I gave her pie OK.

00:05:11.872 --> 00:05:14.031
- You gave Beyoncé human food?

00:05:14.031 --> 00:05:16.329
- [Ashley] I'm sorry, it was Thanksgiving,

00:05:16.329 --> 00:05:19.012
you had just left, I ate
a whole pie by myself,

00:05:19.012 --> 00:05:20.534
I was not in a good place,

00:05:20.534 --> 00:05:22.656
and then she just came
crawling onto my lap,

00:05:22.656 --> 00:05:24.596
which she had never done before,

00:05:24.596 --> 00:05:25.734
and then she started eating the

00:05:25.734 --> 00:05:27.533
pumpkin pie with her little tongue.

00:05:27.533 --> 00:05:28.879
- Ashley how could you give her pie?

00:05:28.879 --> 00:05:29.832
She was a diabetic.

00:05:29.832 --> 00:05:30.957
- I know, I know!

00:05:30.957 --> 00:05:33.849
But she was so warm, and I was so cold.

00:05:33.849 --> 00:05:35.891
And honestly we had
just shared a beautiful

00:05:35.891 --> 00:05:38.536
moment watching Pitch Perfect together.

00:05:41.592 --> 00:05:46.547
- So, you're saying Beyoncé did love me.

00:05:48.035 --> 00:05:49.808
- Of course.

00:05:50.791 --> 00:05:55.380
Quinta, I'm sorry I stole your cat.

00:05:59.818 --> 00:06:01.999
- I'm sorry I left.

00:06:06.656 --> 00:06:09.490
I can't believe she's actually gone.

00:06:09.490 --> 00:06:11.173
- I know.

00:06:11.173 --> 00:06:15.816
♫I can see her halo, halo, halo

00:06:15.816 --> 00:06:16.936
♫I can see her halo...♫

00:06:16.936 --> 00:06:18.260
- No Ashley put the cat down.

00:06:18.260 --> 00:06:20.558
- I know she smells real
bad, we should bury her.

00:06:20.558 --> 00:06:25.558
(heavy guitar music)

